# Story sentences for accounts and signup.
# Each phrase is written in normal HumanTest steps. No code.
# <name> is a placeholder; (text) is optional text.

Phrase: the website has no users
  Start with: empty database

Phrase: <user> signs up with "<email>"
  As <user>:
    go to signup page
    type "<email>" in email
    type "Secret123" in password
    click "Sign up"
    backend should receive POST /api/users
    backend should reply 201 Created
    reply should not contain password

Phrase: <user> should have no orders
  As <user>:
    should see "You have no orders yet"

Phrase: admin should see <count> user(s)
  As admin:
    go to users page
    should see "Total users: <count>"
